basefwx (3.8.0~dev1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Package the 3.8 development API required by YUME 2.0-dev4, including
    explicit-salt HKDF, X25519, and ML-KEM-1024 selection.
  * Keep GPL command-line implementation and headers out of the LGPL shared
    library and development-header package.
  * Run the native CTest policy suite during Debian builds and tighten the
    CMake package compatibility contract to the 3.8 minor line.

 -- FixCraft Maintainers <debian@fixcraft.jp>  Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

basefwx (3.6.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the BaseFWX C++ codec library and CLI.
  * basefwx ships the command-line frontend; libbasefwx3 ships the runtime
    shared library; libbasefwx-dev ships headers, CMake config, and the
    pkg-config file.
  * Debian archive builds use packaged liboqs-dev, libargon2-dev, and
    liblzma-dev by default. Local vendor liboqs builds remain possible only
    through explicit debian/rules environment overrides.
  * Add Vcs metadata, uscan metadata, and superficial autopkgtests for the
    CLI and development package.

 -- FixCraft Maintainers <debian@fixcraft.jp>  Sat, 09 May 2026 22:00:00 -0700
